    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nComing Soon\n\nCastlethorn are delighted to introduce a superb new collection of spacious 2 and 3-bedroom duplex homes at South Coast, Woodbrook, located in the heart of this landmark development.\n\nDesigned with modern living in mind, these stylish duplexes offer generous, light-filled accommodation arranged over two levels, providing an excellent sense of space and separation between living and bedroom areas. Each home benefits from excellent private outdoor space, with contemporary interiors and high-quality finishes throughout.\n\nThe duplexes at South Coast are highly energy efficient and exceptionally well insulated, making them warm, comfortable and economical to run. Typical of Castlethorn's quality and reputation, every home has been thoughtfully designed, beautifully equipped and built to the highest standards.\n\nA major highlight of Woodbrook is the brand-new DART station, providing outstanding connectivity to Dublin City Centre and the surrounding coastal suburbs. This makes South Coast an ideal choice for professionals, commuters, couples and families seeking a well-connected home in an attractive coastal setting.\n\nAs part of the overall masterplan, Woodbrook will also include a school, crèche and neighbourhood centre, creating a well-rounded and community-focused place to live. Residents can enjoy easy access to the coastline and beaches at Shankill, Bray and Killiney, together with excellent schools, shopping, leisure and recreational amenities.\n\nLocated in the northern part of the development, South Coast is laid out around a series of attractive, thoughtfully planned streets and landscaped open spaces. The 2 and 3-bedroom duplexes offer an exciting alternative to traditional apartment living, combining contemporary design, generous accommodation and excellent use of space.\n\nAll homes in Woodbrook are built to Castlethorn's renowned high standards, with an A-rating for energy efficiency and contemporary finishes throughout.\n\nFamilies will benefit from proximity to a range of primary and secondary schools, including Woodbrook College, Scoil Mhuire, St. Gerard's, Presentation College, St. Killian's and Loreto Secondary School. Nearby Shankill Village provides everyday conveniences, while Carrickmines Retail Park and Dundrum Town Centre offer an extensive choice of shopping and leisure amenities.\n\nTo find out more or to register your interest, visit www.south-coast.ie or contact Sherry FitzGerald New Homes on +353 1 667 1888.\n\nUpon registering, your details will be passed to Castlethorn and Sherry FitzGerald."
      },
